1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,730
(Amy:)When did you get
an engagement ring?

2
00:00:02,736 --> 00:00:03,906
(Sheldon:)My mother gave it to me,

3
00:00:03,904 --> 00:00:05,974
(Sheldon:)and I had been thinking
about giving it to you,

4
00:00:05,973 --> 00:00:07,443
(Sheldon:)but then we broke up.

5
00:00:07,441 --> 00:00:09,041
(Meemaw:)Well, thank goodness
for that.

6
00:00:09,042 --> 00:00:11,172
(Amy:)Sheldon, will you please tell
your grandmother

7
00:00:11,178 --> 00:00:12,578
(Amy:)to stay out of this?

8
00:00:12,579 --> 00:00:14,979
(Sheldon:)Oh, I don't think
I could do that.

9
00:00:14,982 --> 00:00:16,712
(Meemaw:)Sheldon, tell this girl

10
00:00:16,717 --> 00:00:19,647
(Meemaw:)that my ring will never be
on her finger.

11
00:00:19,653 --> 00:00:21,023
(sighs) Y...

12
00:00:21,021 --> 00:00:24,221
(Sheldon:)I'm gonna opt out
of that one, too.

13
00:00:24,224 --> 00:00:26,824
(Amy:)Who said I even want
to be engaged to him?

14
00:00:26,827 --> 00:00:28,697
And if I do, I-I don't need
your hand-me-downs!

15
00:00:28,695 --> 00:00:29,695
All right, all right!

16
00:00:29,696 --> 00:00:30,896
Look, l-let's all...

17
00:00:30,898 --> 00:00:32,268
(Sheldon:)let's remain calm

18
00:00:32,266 --> 00:00:33,566
and analyze this situation.

19
00:00:33,567 --> 00:00:35,767
(Sheldon:)Now, I realize that
you've only known each other

20
00:00:35,769 --> 00:00:36,939
(Sheldon:)for less than a day,

21
00:00:36,937 --> 00:00:39,737
(Sheldon:)but is it possible this
crankiness is because

22
00:00:39,740 --> 00:00:41,570
(Sheldon:)your cycles have synced?

23
00:00:41,575 --> 00:00:43,475
(Meemaw:)You leave the room

24
00:00:43,477 --> 00:00:45,347
(Meemaw:)and let the grown-ups talk.

25
00:00:45,345 --> 00:00:46,515
(Penny:)Now.

26
00:00:46,513 --> 00:00:49,443
(Amy:)Don't speak to him
like he's a child.

27
00:00:49,449 --> 00:00:56,019
(Sheldon:)Thank you. I'm gonna go next
door and play with Leonard.

